! Image Preview

A native image preview plugin for TiddlyWiki that adds click-to-enlarge functionality for images.

!! ✨ Features

* **Quick Preview**: Click any image to open a full-screen preview modal.
* **Zoom Controls**: Support for zooming in/out and resetting zoom level.
* **Navigation**: Seamlessly navigate between multiple images on the same page.
* **Keyboard Shortcuts**: Full keyboard support (Arrows, ESC, Ctrl+/-) for efficiency.
* **Universal Support**: Works with dynamically loaded images and requires no external dependencies.
* **Pure Native**: Built with pure JavaScript and CSS, lightweight and fast.

!! 🚀 Usage

1. Install the plugin.
2. Click on any image in your TiddlyWiki to open the preview modal.
3. Use the on-screen controls or keyboard shortcuts to interact.

[img[https://imgbed.baiyapeng.cc/file/1731898035292_avatar.jpg]]

[img[https://imgbed.baiyapeng.cc/file/1766820604037_bingimg_20251221_UHD.jpg]]

!! ⌨️ Keyboard Shortcuts

|! Key |! Action |
| ESC | Close preview |
| ← → | Previous/next image |
| Ctrl + + / Ctrl + - | Zoom in/out |
| Ctrl + 0 | Reset zoom to 100% |
| Mouse wheel | Zoom in/out |

!! 🛠 Customization

You can customize the plugin behavior (such as CSS styles or scaling limits) by modifying the `script.js` file.

